(4955529, 721487, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like this approach to the topic. My nitpick is some skew, which is, admittedly, tough when you have straight lines so close to the edges of the pic. Also, the mailboxes at the left side have the edge cut off, and the other sides don''t. It looks a little awkward.</td>', 'I like this approach to the topic. My nitpick is some skew, which is, admittedly, tough when you have straight lines so close to the edges of the pic. Also, the mailboxes at the left side have the edge cut off, and the other sides don''t. It looks a little awkward.', '2008-09-15 01:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4955533, 721613, 66515, '<td valign="top">If we could actually SEE the numbers I might be convinced but as lovely as this shot is it doesn''t meet the challenge in my opinion.</td>', 'If we could actually SEE the numbers I might be convinced but as lovely as this shot is it doesn''t meet the challenge in my opinion.', '2008-09-15 01:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4955534, 721630, 83313, '<td valign="top">Now how did you manage that? Reminds me of taking the sticker from the Dole bananas and putting it on my nose, like the kid in the old commercial did.</td>', 'Now how did you manage that? Reminds me of taking the sticker from the Dole bananas and putting it on my nose, like the kid in the old commercial did.', '2008-09-15 01:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
