(4955559, 721334, 83313, '<td valign="top">Well, I suppose T168 can join such famous names as Number six and 7 of 9. Cropped a little too tight top and bottom for my personal preference.</td>', 'Well, I suppose T168 can join such famous names as Number six and 7 of 9. Cropped a little too tight top and bottom for my personal preference.', '2008-09-15 01:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
