(4955677, 721516, 47541, '<td valign="top">One Tree Hill as I''ve never seen it before.  It looks just like a lighthouse in this.  But do I like it...?<br/> <br/>Well Rina, the cloud streaks are great and the lighting effect on the monument are also great, especially given the length this exposure must have been.  I do however find the grass area just too dark for my liking.  I also feel that there should be a little less grass area at the bottom, perhaps crop off close to an inch?</td>', 'One Tree Hill as I''ve never seen it before.  It looks just like a lighthouse in this.  But do I like it...? Well Rina, the cloud streaks are great and the lighting effect on the monument are also great, especially given the length this exposure must have been.  I do however find the grass area just too dark for my liking.  I also feel that there should be a little less grass area at the bottom, perhaps crop off close to an inch?', '2008-09-15 03:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4955681, 721663, 10794, '<td valign="top">654</td>', '654', '2008-09-15 03:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
