(4955721, 720908, 47541, '<td valign="top">I gave this an extra point because you put some thought and effort into this rather than just a "quick and dirty lets play on the ''troll'' theme" shot that would have been all too easy</td>', 'I gave this an extra point because you put some thought and effort into this rather than just a "quick and dirty lets play on the ''troll'' theme" shot that would have been all too easy', '2008-09-15 05:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
