(4956813, 721659, 53416, '<td valign="top">I love the abstract quality of this photograph.  I''m not even sure what it is, but I really like the colours and composition.  The soft focus (intentional or not?) also works for me.  Well done!</td>', 'I love the abstract quality of this photograph.  I''m not even sure what it is, but I really like the colours and composition.  The soft focus (intentional or not?) also works for me.  Well done!', '2008-09-15 17:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4956815, 721595, 53416, '<td valign="top">I like the framing of the focal point with the glasses - but it feels a little too central for my liking?</td>', 'I like the framing of the focal point with the glasses - but it feels a little too central for my liking?', '2008-09-15 17:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4956816, 721580, 53416, '<td valign="top">Cute idea nicely executed.  Well done!</td>', 'Cute idea nicely executed.  Well done!', '2008-09-15 18:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4956818, 721309, 53416, '<td valign="top">Certainly a lot of numbers here!  I wonder if it might work better with a shallower depth of field so that the first subject really stands out, and the subjects in the backround are much more blurry?</td>', 'Certainly a lot of numbers here!  I wonder if it might work better with a shallower depth of field so that the first subject really stands out, and the subjects in the backround are much more blurry?', '2008-09-15 18:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4956822, 720928, 53416, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple observational photograph that is really quite pleasing to look at.  I think it would work better if you''d taken the photo from a steeper angle, so that the post box was framed without the slightly distracting light green strip at the top of the picture?</td>', 'Nice and simple observational photograph that is really quite pleasing to look at.  I think it would work better if you''d taken the photo from a steeper angle, so that the post box was framed without the slightly distracting light green strip at the top of the picture?', '2008-09-15 18:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
