(4962369, 721653, 49954, '<td valign="top">With advanced, you should have blended the label into the skin a little more.  Nice idea though.</td>', 'With advanced, you should have blended the label into the skin a little more.  Nice idea though.', '2008-09-18 18:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
