(4962470, 720920, 66515, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. The tape creates a nice leading line into the frame. Focus seems a little off however. Since this is staged I would definitely have gone for more DOF.</td>', 'Interesting composition. The tape creates a nice leading line into the frame. Focus seems a little off however. Since this is staged I would definitely have gone for more DOF.', '2008-09-18 19:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4962472, 721074, 66515, '<td valign="top">The composition seems somewhat weird to me. I am not really sure what I am supposed to be looking at. The way its composed in fact almost makes me think its the ref that you are trying to get us to look at.</td>', 'The composition seems somewhat weird to me. I am not really sure what I am supposed to be looking at. The way its composed in fact almost makes me think its the ref that you are trying to get us to look at.', '2008-09-18 19:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
