(4964767, 721627, 22970, '<td valign="top">Very clean with nice focus and lighting. The DOF makes this shot. High Marks!</td>', 'Very clean with nice focus and lighting. The DOF makes this shot. High Marks!', '2008-09-19 18:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4964770, 721541, 22970, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. The colors, light, and focus is outstanding.</td>', 'Very interesting. The colors, light, and focus is outstanding.', '2008-09-19 18:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4964789, 721578, 22970, '<td valign="top">Undoubtedly my favorite. Everything from the photo to the processing and everything in between clicks. Should Ribbon!</td>', 'Undoubtedly my favorite. Everything from the photo to the processing and everything in between clicks. Should Ribbon!', '2008-09-19 18:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4964801, 721595, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph. Lighting, focus, and compensation good. The use of the glasses as an extra element made the photograph work. High Marks!</td>', 'Nice photograph. Lighting, focus, and compensation good. The use of the glasses as an extra element made the photograph work. High Marks!', '2008-09-19 18:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4964826, 720908, 22970, '<td valign="top">Normally I would not score a photograph of an plastic figure high but in this case you pulled it off. Not only did you do a fantastic job photographing and setting up the picture; it also tells the story with or without a title. Nice idea and you nailed it. Great job! High Marks!</td>', 'Normally I would not score a photograph of an plastic figure high but in this case you pulled it off. Not only did you do a fantastic job photographing and setting up the picture; it also tells the story with or without a title. Nice idea and you nailed it. Great job! High Marks!', '2008-09-19 19:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965094, 721541, 98182, '<td valign="top">cool picture in my appion it perfect but im not even close to being intemediate so i think it awesome=]</td>', 'cool picture in my appion it perfect but im not even close to being intemediate so i think it awesome=]', '2008-09-19 22:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
