(4965558, 721645, 53892, '<td valign="top">jon  mukane</td>', 'jon  mukane', '2008-09-20 11:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965979, 721502, 50120, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice...</td>', 'Interesting choice...', '2008-09-20 18:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966096, 721660, 65234, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Like the title :-)</td>', 'LOL!  Like the title :-)', '2008-09-20 20:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966171, 721463, 86447, '<td valign="top">Perhaps if you had used almost any other card this would have a ''number'' in it as the requirements state... *sorry*    Really.   As it is, there is no number in the image.   It''s well done, though.  I can even see the grain in the cards.</td>', 'Perhaps if you had used almost any other card this would have a ''number'' in it as the requirements state... *sorry*    Really.   As it is, there is no number in the image.   It''s well done, though.  I can even see the grain in the cards.', '2008-09-20 22:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966173, 721645, 86447, '<td valign="top">Where is the number(s)?</td>', 'Where is the number(s)?', '2008-09-20 22:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966176, 721606, 86447, '<td valign="top">I see dots... I don''t see ''number(s)'' as the requirements state.  <br/> <br/>I know that domino dots ''represent'' numbers.. .but still... they''re just not numbers.   So this isn''t a photograph of numbers.   <br/> <br/>BUT, it''s a very well taken image.  I like the DOF and the focus.  The color is well done, too.</td>', 'I see dots... I don''t see ''number(s)'' as the requirements state.   I know that domino dots ''represent'' numbers.. .but still... they''re just not numbers.   So this isn''t a photograph of numbers.    BUT, it''s a very well taken image.  I like the DOF and the focus.  The color is well done, too.', '2008-09-20 22:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966191, 720464, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and concept but to me the blacks look flat, lacking contrast. However, it is still a nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot and concept but to me the blacks look flat, lacking contrast. However, it is still a nice shot.', '2008-09-20 22:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966192, 721663, 22970, '<td valign="top">I see number everywhere in your photograph. Not to mention the obvious but things like how many time has he recalled his memories serving his Country, his age, how many gray hairs, how high does he have to set his hearing aid...the list could go on and on. <br/> <br/>Very crisp shot where the lighting is good and the focus is great. Composition is good and the DOF really separates the subject from the background. Very nice work!!</td>', 'I see number everywhere in your photograph. Not to mention the obvious but things like how many time has he recalled his memories serving his Country, his age, how many gray hairs, how high does he have to set his hearing aid...the list could go on and on.  Very crisp shot where the lighting is good and the focus is great. Composition is good and the DOF really separates the subject from the background. Very nice work!!', '2008-09-20 22:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4966533, 720464, 96823, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, I like the reflection. The only problem is what looks like a finger print at top of the six or the bottom of the nine. Other then that it''s good capture!</td>', 'Nicely done, I like the reflection. The only problem is what looks like a finger print at top of the six or the bottom of the nine. Other then that it''s good capture!', '2008-09-21 10:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
