(4967413, 721246, 67697, '<td valign="top">You and Lydia finish as neighbors in the challenge.  Good sign! :)  Great photo.  I like the leading lines and how you highlighted the number too.</td>', 'You and Lydia finish as neighbors in the challenge.  Good sign! :)  Great photo.  I like the leading lines and how you highlighted the number too.', '2008-09-22 01:21:32.000000', NULL, 0),
