(4967423, 720920, 67697, '<td valign="top">Very nice - I like how you have the coil leading thru the picture.  My preference would have been to see a little more contrast so that the tape does not appear to be the same color as the background.</td>', 'Very nice - I like how you have the coil leading thru the picture.  My preference would have been to see a little more contrast so that the tape does not appear to be the same color as the background.', '2008-09-22 01:24:36.000000', NULL, 0),
