(4968351, 720963, 66384, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don''t like toilet shots, especially dirty ones. But I seem to be in the minority according to your score. I didn''t vote on it though, so I didn''t do any harm. Just based on the processing, I would have given a high score. You have a very individual style to your processing, and I like it a lot.</td>', 'Sorry, I don''t like toilet shots, especially dirty ones. But I seem to be in the minority according to your score. I didn''t vote on it though, so I didn''t do any harm. Just based on the processing, I would have given a high score. You have a very individual style to your processing, and I like it a lot.', '2008-09-22 13:08:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4968363, 721553, 66384, '<td valign="top">It took me a little too long to figure out what those beans had to do with an adding machine -- duh, ''bean counter'' -- I was just a little slow. The composition feels static to me, with all those horizontal lines.</td>', 'It took me a little too long to figure out what those beans had to do with an adding machine -- duh, ''bean counter'' -- I was just a little slow. The composition feels static to me, with all those horizontal lines.', '2008-09-22 13:16:44.000000', NULL, 0),
