(4974035, 721168, 70514, '<td valign="top">I''ll be honest... I didn''t notice the swastika.  I''ve seen these numbers on patients before, and they''re so shocking and profound, I guess I was just awed by the power of the actual subject.  Still a great image to get a message across and so well done is something... scores are just scores.</td>', 'I''ll be honest... I didn''t notice the swastika.  I''ve seen these numbers on patients before, and they''re so shocking and profound, I guess I was just awed by the power of the actual subject.  Still a great image to get a message across and so well done is something... scores are just scores.', '2008-09-25 01:43:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4974037, 721665, 70514, '<td valign="top">Well... you know I love your style of artistry and photography, so this will hold little consellation for you (sorry, can''t spell).  I love this image.  The detail and sharpness is astounding, I love the distortion and conversion.  Very cool and so interesting... I mean, what exactly is "22" all about?  I dunno, but I have a few ideas :)</td>', 'Well... you know I love your style of artistry and photography, so this will hold little consellation for you (sorry, can''t spell).  I love this image.  The detail and sharpness is astounding, I love the distortion and conversion.  Very cool and so interesting... I mean, what exactly is "22" all about?  I dunno, but I have a few ideas :)', '2008-09-25 01:45:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4974040, 721342, 70514, '<td valign="top">Sheesh, you get the focus just right and "they" still aren''t happy.  Great colors and attention to the subject.  $3 isn''t bad for some fun!</td>', 'Sheesh, you get the focus just right and "they" still aren''t happy.  Great colors and attention to the subject.  $3 isn''t bad for some fun!', '2008-09-25 01:48:05.000000', NULL, 0),
