(4977337, 721572, 95687, '<td valign="top">A manufactured opportunity for a photo in this day and age?  It''s scandalous!<br/> <br/>I appreciate the the thought, planning, and excellent execution of this image.<br/> <br/>For the naysayers, please don''t ever go to a commercial photo shot or video shoot.  The shock may do you in.<br/> <br/>:-)<br/> <br/>This is great work.</td>', 'A manufactured opportunity for a photo in this day and age?  It''s scandalous! I appreciate the the thought, planning, and excellent execution of this image. For the naysayers, please don''t ever go to a commercial photo shot or video shoot.  The shock may do you in. :-) This is great work.', '2008-09-26 20:29:28.000000', NULL, 0),
